title: Days
---

<<declare $day_number = 1>>

title: EndDay
---
End of Day {$day_number}.
<<run show_day_screen($day_number)>>
-> NextDay
===

title: NextDay
---
Day {$day_number}
<<set $day_number = $day_number + 1>>
-> Continue
===

title: Continue
---
<<if $day_number == 2>>
    <<jump Day2Start>>
<<elseif $day_number == 3>>
    <<jump Day3Start>>
<<else>>
    <<jump TheEnd>>
<<endif>>
===